# From Saplings Grow (windurst 85): the offer without the bow, and the level edge's met side. A level-71 RNG (the Bow of
# Trials' level) at Archery 2500: 661 (oncePerZone); its finish with a full bag (no bow: giveItem false, not begun); a
# second talk in the zone falls to his default 338 (oncePerZone: priority Ignore); after a rezone 661 again, begun (the
# bow, 0 weapon skill points, and the Weapon Training Guide).
lists WindurstWoods/Perih_Vashai/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/661
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=119.5,-3.7,90.45 job=RNG lvl=71
quest Windurst.TheFangedOne completed
quest Windurst.SinHunting completed
quest Windurst.FireAndBrimstone completed
quest Windurst.UnbridledPassion completed
skill Archery 2500
login
trigger Perih_Vashai                                   # level 71, Archery 2500, no guide: event 661 (oncePerZone)
fill-inventory
finish                                              # no bow, the bag full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Perih_Vashai                                   # 661 played this zone: his default 338
finish
rezone
trigger Perih_Vashai                                   # after the rezone: 661 again
finish                                              # the Bow of Trials and the Weapon Training Guide: begun
